   "description": "<h1>FW Knight Mask Fix (SPT 4.0.13)</h1>\n<p><strong>Fixes the missing “Death Knight” mask texture on Knight PMC and all player models.</strong></p>\n<h2>Installation</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>Drag or extract the ’SPT` folder inside of the downloaded “FWKnightMaskFix.zip” directly into your SPT root directory where EscapeFromTarkov.exe, server.exe, and launcher.exe are located.</li>\n</ol>\n<h2>Credits</h2>\n<p>Derivative of <strong>Umbigo Preto’s “Face the Knight - Mask Fix”</strong> (MIT License).<br />\nThank you to Umbigo Preto for the original work that made this possible!</p>\n<h2>Compatibility</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Tested on SPT 4.0.13+</li>\n<li>Standalone (no dependencies)</li>\n<li>Works with SAIN, SVM, and 99.9% of other mods.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Source Code</h2>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/TheOfficialSkull/FW---Knight-Mask-Fix---4.0.13\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://github.com/TheOfficialSkull/FW---Knight-Mask-Fix---4.0.13</a></p>\n<p>Made current for the SPT community ❤️</p>\n",
